WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
Stop building narrated videos frame by frame.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.800
Give Narova a prompt, and watch this.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.200
It creates local voiceover, lights captions word by word,

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.800
and reveals graphics on the spoken beat.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:16.400
Initialize a project. Write scenes. Then synthesize, preview, and build.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:21.100
Audio sets the timing. HyperFrames turns your HTML visuals into a rendered MP4.

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:29.803
No API keys. No cloud. Just invoke the Narova skill, describe your video, and let it roll.
